     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">When I tried to increase the &#39;sockjs_disconnect_delay&#39; value in my Shiny Server, I&#39;m getting an error like <font color=\"#ff0000\">&#39;Error loading config: Unknown directive &quot;sockjs_disconnect_delay&quot; (/etc/shiny-server/shiny-server.conf:6:1)&#39;</font>.<div><br></div><div>Following is my configuration. </div><div><br></div><div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,204)\">run_as shiny;</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">access_log /var/log/shiny-server/access.log tiny;</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">disable_websockets;</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,204)\">sockjs_disconnect_delay 200.50;</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">http_keepalive_timeout 220.50;<br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"># Define a server that listens on port 3838</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">server {</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">  listen 3838;</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">  # Define a location at the base URL</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">  location / {</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,204)\">    site_dir /srv/shiny-server;</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,204)\">    log_dir /var/log/shiny-server;</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,204)\">    directory_index on;</span><br></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">    app_init_timeout 1800;</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">    app_idle_timeout 1800;</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">    #Show original error</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">    sanitize_errors false;</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">  }</span><span style=\"color:#0000cc\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#0000cc\">}</span><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>Is this work only in &#39;Pro&#39; or my configuration is not proper? <br><div><br></div><div>Shiny Server v1.5.1.834<br></div></div><div>OS Ubuntu 16.04 </div></div>"
